#==============================================================================================
#
#   flex_formatting_context_2 - Layout::FlexFormattingContext: the flex items, main and cross
#                               sizes, the used flex basis and aspect ratios
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp (lines 349-653): sifting the flex
#       container's children into flex items in `order`, definite and inner main/cross sizes,
#       specified min/max sizes, setting sizes, offsets and margins along the axes, the
#       available space for the items, the used flex-basis, and the conversions through a
#       preferred aspect ratio (with its min/max constraints).
