## Ported from Libraries/LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp:412 Web::Layout::FlexFormattingContext::has_main_min_size.
func layout_flex_formatting_context_has_main_min_size(this: LayoutFlexFormattingContext*, box: LayoutBox*) -> bool:
