## Ported from Libraries/LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp:543 Web::Layout::FlexFormattingContext::set_main_axis_first_margin.
func layout_flex_formatting_context_set_main_axis_first_margin(this: LayoutFlexFormattingContext*, item: LayoutFlexFormattingContextFlexItem*, margin: gfx.CssPixels):
    item.margins.main_before = margin
    if layout_flex_formatting_context_main_axis_is_horizontal(this):
        item.used_values.margin_left = margin
    else:
        item.used_values.margin_top = margin

## Ported from Libraries/LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp:552 Web::Layout::FlexFormattingContext::set_main_axis_second_margin.
func layout_flex_formatting_context_set_main_axis_second_margin(this: LayoutFlexFormattingContext*, item: LayoutFlexFormattingContextFlexItem*, margin: gfx.CssPixels):
